{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4063","title":"POCO Powers Ahead with POCO X7 Series, Blending Unparalleled Performance with Bold Design","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X7 Pro, POCO X7, and a special POCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition to its X Series.","view_cnt":"6966","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1735291024","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/8_operatorx_operatorx_opx/27/12/2024/ffa6408af4ed32850afdade4159adc91.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eBeijing, China, January 9, 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e – POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X7 Pro, POCO X7, and a special POCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition to its X Series, continuing to push the boundaries of practicality, durability, and trend-setting style, while promising an unprecedented experience for those who seek powerful tech performance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/697_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/7e2abe2afafa02c59669c94fd948f9cb.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e\"POCO X7 Series sets all-new benchmarks in merging high-performance technology with unique, impactful design,\" said Angus Ng, Head of Product Marketing at POCO Global. \"Whether it's the exclusive POCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition, which stands out with its bold, dynamic design inspired by the iconic superhero, the flagship-level power of POCO X7 Pro, or the all-around versatility of POCO X7, our goal is to offer an experience that is both powerful and personal, empowering users to get the most out of their devices.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eDeliver flagship-level performance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAt the core of POCO X7 Pro is the flagship Dimensity 8400-Ultra processor, making its global debut as the most powerful chipset in the X Series. Built on TSMC's advanced 4nm processor and featuring the leading All-Big-Core design, the Dimensity 8400-Ultra achieves cutting-edge power efficiencies gain - 54%¹ from the CPU and 70%¹ from the GPU - while boasting a 50%² boost in AI performance compared to its predecessor. Together, these enhancements make POCO X7 Pro compact and power-efficient in its category.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/722_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/c739e114db700aca696241674d770c6a.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro also comes out-of-box with the latest Xiaomi HyperOS 2³, offering a revolutionary upgrade from the core system to the UI design. This enhanced system delivers a faster, smarter, and smoother user experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePowered by Xiaomi HyperOS 2 and Dimensity 8400-Ultra, POCO X7 Pro features the upgraded WildBoost Optimization 3.0 that leverages an in-house algorithm to provide a more stable frame rate, enhanced connection stability, immersive sound effects, and stunning graphics even in demanding titles like Genshin Impact at 1.5K AI super resolution⁴, taking your gaming experience to a new level. To further cater to hardcore gamers, the revamped UI design reinforces stoppable power.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/542_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/d9775c0df0f6472e03b6a87f54f666a6.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro is equipped with LiquidCool Technology 4.0 to keep things cool under pressure. Featuring a 5000mm² ultra-large cooling area⁵, the POCO 3D IceLoop System efficiently separates vapor and liquid. Further more, a specially engineered 3D structure around the CPU helps to dissipate heat more efficiently, leading to 3 times more effective than the traditional vapor chamber⁶.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7, on the other hand, runs on the powerful Dimensity 7300-Ultra for potent power efficiency. With an AnTuTu score of 704,404⁷, it easily handles power-intensive tasks like gaming and video processing. POCO X7 also supports RAM expansion up to 24GB⁸, enabling smoother multitasking and improved performance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/402_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/382b50ca6424b894caf82901db96abaa.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eReliable lifespan with innovative battery and charging\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro and POCO X7 are designed to keep up with the most demanding users, offering reliable, long-lasting power for all-day use. POCO X7 Pro takes the lead with its 6000mAh (typ) battery⁹ - the largest battery capacity in the brand’s history¹º - that offers up to 14.5¹¹ hours of continuous use. Paired with 90W¹² HyperCharge, it can go from 0 to 100% in just 42¹³ minutes, ensuring minimal downtime and keeping users powered through even the busiest days.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/227_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/8cc24fe6f87838055fc68d51e8ce87a6.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7, with its 5110mAh (typ)¹⁴ battery, also delivers impressive endurance. Its 45W turbo charging¹⁵ ensures users can quickly recharge and get back to their routine without interruption. Both devices are designed for longevity, retaining over 80%¹⁶ battery capacity even after 1600 charge cycles, providing long-term reliability and performance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eBeyond capacity, POCO X7 Series aims to provide safer and more intelligent charging experiences thanks to Smart Charging Engine. The new Perceptive charging can automatically adjust charging speed and temperature control according to your usage. Additionally, both devices are designed to withstand extreme conditions beyond everyday use. POCO X7 Pro supports charging at temperatures as low as -25°C¹¹, while POCO X7 is able to make voice calls at -10℃ for up to 24¹¹ hours and standby for 66¹¹ hours.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eStylish, slim, yet strong\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Series seamlessly blends advanced display technology with sophisticated design and rugged durability. POCO X7 Pro and POCO X7 feature a 6.67'' CrystalRes 1.5K 120Hz AMOLED display with 68 billion colors for rich, vibrant visuals, offering peak brightness of 3200¹⁷ and 3000¹⁸ nits, respectively, for clear visibility in bright outdoor conditions. Thanks to a 2560Hz¹⁹ instant sampling rate and 16x super-resolution touch, the devices provide an uninterrupted and more responsive experience. At the same time, this upgraded Wet Touch display ensures reliable touch recognition even when hands are accidentally wet or oily. With Triple TÜV Rheinland certifications²º, both devices are designed to keep the eyes comfortable during prolonged use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/297_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/80607591de3d851347f7cf989d1895cd.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro and POCO X7\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eMaking POCO X7 Pro as stylish as powerful, the design blends minimalist elegance with racetrack-inspired lines and flowing Bézier curves, complemented by a dual-turbo ring design. The Yellow variant takes it further with a dual tone color and a dual-tone texture. POCO X7 also debuts the brand’s first 3D curved display, enhancing the grip experience horizontally and vertically. Available in sophisticated hues like Black with a vegan leather back, POCO X7 strikes the perfect balance between sporty aesthetics and refined elegance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/425_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/0cbcd92b4898339155f1830a231a2741.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro – all colors\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/316_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/8f38be9a9b82fd74c52f1272bfae0679.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 – all colors\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eFor enhanced screen protection, POCO X7 Pro features an incredibly tough Corning® Gorilla® Glass 7i which has improved twice²¹ in scratch resistance and drop resistance. Meanwhile, POCO X7 is protected by Corning® Gorilla® Glass Victus® 2, offering 55%²² better drop resistance. Both phones also boast an IP68²³ rating for dust and water resistance - offering enhanced protection with water resistance of up to 1.5 meters for 30 minutes. POCO X7 further features an innovative cushioning structure to enhance its resistance to impact. With its robust build quality, POCO X7 Series is designed to withstand everyday wear and tear.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/551_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/93b063f2eb0352868ceb6e2a32e48833.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 – Protection structure\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eUnleash creativity with pro-level camera system\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Series elevates smartphone photography with its advanced camera setup. Both POCO X7 Pro and POCO X7 feature a Sony's IMX882 50MP main camera with flagship-quality OIS, offering 65%²⁴ more light intake for sharper, more vibrant photos - even in low light. POCO X7 also adds versatility with its 2MP macro lens, perfect for intricate close-up shots. For those who love taking selfies, both models come with a 20MP front camera, delivering crisp, detailed images that make every shot stand out.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/297_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/72a3580db9444f4394c4ee8f1ba78609.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eTo offer a better portrait shooting experience, both models utilize enhanced AI algorithms that allow users to create stunning portraits with a natural bokeh effect. To capture defined facial expressions, POCO X7 features a 46mm Golden Portrait Mode, while POCO X7 Pro introduces dual focal lengths of 26mm and 35mm.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/26_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/8b1644c889e5a2112936e4069fe5026c.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eYet with POCO X7 Series, taking great photos is just the beginning. The Series also integrates a suite of innovative features to elevate your photography experience. For action-packed moments, Dynamic shots²⁵ brings your photos to life with motion. UltraSnap²⁶ on POCO X7 Pro ensures clear captures of fast-moving objects and minimizing motion blur. In addition, innovative AI-driven features make editing and enhancing photos as simple as a tap. The latest AI Erase Pro²⁷ lets you remove unwanted passersby for flawless shots, while AI Image Expansion²⁷ helps salvage poorly composed images. Additionally, AI Film simplifies the process of creating cinematic short videos.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/122_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/7f513e3776dd872f6b2318670b52fdf9.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eBoth POCO X7 Pro and POCO X7 excel in videography, ensuring stable footage even in fast-moving or shaky situations. POCO X7 supports 4K video recording at 30fps, while POCO X7 Pro steps it up with 4K at 60fps, capturing every detail with OIS and EIS²⁸ dual stabilization. POCO X7 Pro offers Director Mode and 10bit-LOG video recording for more creative freedom, putting professional-level color grading and editing tools at your fingertips.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eSmart experiences powered by advanced GenAI\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eWith GenAI²⁹ at its core, POCO X7 Pro elevates everyday productivity and creativity with intelligent AI-driven tools. Features like AI Interpreter³º bridge language barriers for smoother communication in meetings and calls. AI Notes³º and AI Recorder³º help capture and summarize key points from audio content with real-time translation, ensuring accurate interactions across languages.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAdditionally, both POCO X7 and POCO X7 Pro come Google Gemini³¹ app. Chat with Gemini, your AI assistant from Google. Get help writing, brainstorming, learning, and more.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO x Marvel: Powering heroic aspirations with unmatched performance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eBuilding on its commitment to delivering cutting-edge performance to fans, POCO takes things further with the POCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition³², a collaboration with Marvel that merges advanced technology with the spirit of Tony Stark's ingenuity. This special edition embodies POCO's brand philosophy, blending powerful performance with bold aesthetics.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/346_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/740dc7a9a03179d95a267453277239ab.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eThe rear panel of the POCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition is a work of art, showcasing a 3D relief enhanced with platinum detailing, where Iron Man's iconic helmet and Arc Reactor take center stage. With the striking exterior of metallic gold accents and deep red tones, the device mirrors the iconic Iron Man color scheme, flowing into an immersive UI that transports users into Stark's world with red app borders. POCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition delivers not just a smartphone but the power and precision of Stark's engineering, encapsulating POCO's vision of performance at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/930_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/12/2024/cf64c43c7aadad9917cdf44e7b8b50bd.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro - Iron Man Edition will be available in 12GB+512GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro will be available in three striking colors: Black, Green, and Yellow.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eIt will be available in three variants: 8GB+256GB, 12GB+256GB, and 12GB+512GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 is available in three colors: Silver, Green, and Black.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eIt will be available in variants 8GB + 256GB and 12GB + 512GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003emi.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eENDS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e1 CPU and GPU power efficiency tested by POCO Internal Labs under the same performance conditions. Efficiency based on peak efficiency. Actual results may vary based on different testing conditions. CPU data is based on SPECint2K6 workload, from D8400 A725 compared with D8300 A715, while GPU data is based on GFXbench5 1440P AztecRuins Vulkan, compared with D8300.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAI performance data provided by MediaTek, based on ETHZ AI Benchmark v6, compared with D8300.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e3 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAvailability of Xiaomi HyperOS 2 features, apps, and services may vary depending on regions, software version, and phone model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e1.5K AI Super resolution currently can only support Genshin lmpact.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e5 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eData obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Industry measurement standards may vary, and therefore actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e6 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eData tested by POCO Internal Labs. Compared to previous generation. Actual results may vary. Traditional VC refers to a vapor chamber with no internal vapor-liquid separating design.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eOverall performance data tested based on AnTuTu v10 by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary. Compared to previous generation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e8 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e8GB+256GB variant can expand up to 16GB of RAM, 12GB+512GB variant can expand up to 24GB of RAM. Create additional RAM to occupy your device's selected ROM storage. Memory extension needs to be opened in the setting and is only available when your device has enough storage space. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e9 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e6000mAh refers to the typical value, as tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual battery capacity may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e10 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eIn relation to the range of POCO products as of 01/09/2025.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e11\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e Data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e12 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e90W wired charging means the adapter output power is 90W. Actual power output may vary depending on the environment. Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eData is obtained from POCO Internal Labs with a test temperature of approximately 25℃. Actual results may vary due to different test environments. Please refer to actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e14 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e5110mAh refers to the typical value, as tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual battery capacity may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e15 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e45W turbo charging means the adapter output power is 45W. Availability of in-box charger may vary by region. Please consult your local official sales channels for more information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e16 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eBattery cell capacity retention rate ≥ 80% after 1600 cycles under internal standard laboratory environment, actual result may vary based on different conditions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e17 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e3200 nits refers to peak brightness. Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e18 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e3000 nits refers to peak brightness. Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e19 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e2560Hz instant touch sampling rate supports only with Game Turbo mode on.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e20 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO X7 Pro and POCO X7 have been tested and certified by TÜV Rheinland for low blue light, but this product is not a medical device and should not be used for treatment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e21 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eData is obtained from comparison with Corning® Gorilla® Glass 5, and may vary due to different testing conditions and environments.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e22 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eData is obtained from comparison with last generation, and may vary due to different testing conditions and environments.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e23 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eThe device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed for repair. For more information, please see official website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e24 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e+65% light intake compared to previous generation, based on the light intake per individual pixel. Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e25 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eDynamic shots may not support sharing via third-party apps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e26 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eUltraSnap supports normal shooting mode and portrait mode. Doesn't support HDR.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e27 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eCloud-based AI Image Expansion and AI Erase Pro will be available via OTA by end of March 2025. Internet connection required.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e28 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eOIS and EIS can only be applied in supported mode and format.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e29 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAvailability of AI features may vary based on region. Please check your local website for more information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e30 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAI Notes, AI Recorder, and AI Interpreter are available in select languages. Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e31 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eGoogle and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC. Results are for illustrative purposes. Check the responses for accuracy. Screen images simulated. Requires internet connection. Available in select countries and languages.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003e32 Visual for demonstration purposes only. Actual appearance and UI may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1795","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1736426176"},"common":null}